---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Governance — Kokonut Foundation" description="Foundation governance.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-strong">Governance</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">Kokonut Foundation is a nonprofit deploying the Kokonut Framework. Governance combines Foundation stewardship with community participation via Kokonut Network.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-muted">
      <p>Decision-making processes, relevant public governance resources, and governance contracts where appropriate will be published here.</p>
      <p>Blockchain terminology is avoided where plain language suffices.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
